<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Gravel Race Simulation</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Normal meal ~2h before. One bottle, 40-50g carbs. Done.

WARM-UP:
-2min building from Z1 to Z2

MAIN SET:
- 3 x (2min @ 65% FTP (Z2, RPE 3) + 1min @ 110% FTP (Z5+, RPE 8-9) + 2min @ 65% FTP (Z2, RPE 3) + 1min @ 110% FTP (Z5+, RPE 8-9) + 2min @ 65% FTP (Z2, RPE 3) + 1min @ 85% FTP (Z3, RPE 5-6))
- 2min @ 65% FTP (Z2, RPE 3)
-Cadence: 90-105rpm (attack cadence on efforts, recovery spin between)
-Position: Race position - match real race movements

COOL-DOWN:
-1min easy spin Z1-Z2

PROGRESSION:
-Level 4/6: Progressive - Increased challenge, refining execution
-Six sectors across 3.5 hours. Simulate late-race fatigue decisions

EXECUTION:
-Ride the opening tempo under control, settle at threshold, make the final lift clean, then recover at the prescribed power.</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="120" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.70" />
    <SteadyState Duration="120" Power="0.65" CadenceLow="85" CadenceHigh="95" />
    <SteadyState Duration="60" Power="1.10" CadenceLow="85" CadenceHigh="95" />
